# South Africa GDP & Inflation Analysis

## Project Overview

This project analysed the relationship between South Africa's GDP growth and inflation over the historical period from 1960 to 2023.

The analysis examined trends, patterns and relationships between the two economic indicators, with a comparison of the apartheid and post-apartheid periods.

## Project Type

**Academic Group Project**  
**Module:** Data Analysis / Data Visualization

## My Contribution

